; On the Sunny Side of the Street (Jimmy McHugh / Dorothy Fields, 1930)
; Melody and changes from Veesh's chart (an octave up for the trumpet); the opening pickup
; (E D) closes the loop instead. Each line ends with its bar numbers.
; bpm: Side B's levels are timed to Tiger Rag's tempo, so its tunes keep it.

